{"seq":1,"slug":"gil-design-switching-cost","title":"GIL 设计原理：全局锁语义、切换检查点与 sys.setswitchinterval 的代价模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/cpython-interpreter-gil-memory-internals/gil-concurrency-runtime/gil-design-switching-cost","wordCount":2644,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"gil-设计原理-全局锁语义-切换检查点与-sys-setswitchinterval-的代价模型\">GIL 设计原理：全局锁语义、切换检查点与 sys.setswitchinterval 的代价模型</h1><p>一个跑在 16 核机器上的 Python 报价聚合服务，把「拉取汇率」拆成 16 个线程并发执行，压测却发现吞吐只有单线程的数倍，而不是 16 倍；把并发改成 <code>asyncio</code> 之后同一个进程的吞吐反而更高。这个现象不是线程写错了，而是 CPython 的全局解释器锁（Global Interpreter Lock，GIL）在按自己的规则决定「谁在什么时候能执行字节码」。要解释它，需要分别回答三件事：GIL 保护的是什么语义、线程在哪些检查点让出、以及让出之间的时间片 <code>sys.setswitchinterval()</code> 到底怎么折算成墙钟成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-gil-保护的语义与运行时不变量\">核心概念：GIL 保护的语义与运行时不变量</h2><p>GIL 是一把互斥锁，但它保护的从来不是用户数据，而是解释器自身的几条运行时前提。理解这一点才能明白为什么「手动加锁也换不来并行」。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>引用计数必须原子。</strong> CPython 的每个对象头带 <code>ob_refcnt</code>；一次临时引用会让计数 +1，作用域结束 -1，计数归零立即 <code>dealloc</code>。这套逻辑散落在上千个 C 函数里，靠 GIL 让「读计数、改计数、判断归零」三步天然互斥。</li>\n<li><strong>字节码执行不能交错。</strong> 解释器主循环 <code>ceval.c</code> 里是 <code>TARGET(op) { ... }</code> 的巨型 <code>switch</code>，每个 opcode 内部会直接解引用栈上的对象指针。如果两条线程能在 opcode 中间切换，栈与 <code>frame</code> 链就会看到半更新的状态。</li>\n<li><strong>容器内部结构不能被撕裂。</strong> <code>dict</code> 的开放寻址表、<code>list</code> 的 <code>ob_item</code> 扩容、<code>set</code> 的探测序列，都假设同一时刻只有一个执行者。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这带来两个常被误读的结论。其一，<strong>GIL 不等于业务线程安全</strong>：<code>lst.append(x)</code> 这类单条字节码操作确实受 GIL 保护，但 <code>counter += 1</code> 会被编译成 <code>LOAD_FAST / BINARY_OP / STORE_FAST</code> 多条 opcode，另一条线程可以在 <code>BINARY_OP</code> 之后插进来，于是丢更新（lost update）依然发生——跨境电商常用的「扣库存」「累加已售」正是这一类。其二，<strong>纯计算任务拿不到多核</strong>：既然同时只有一个线程在执行字节码，CPU-bound 代码的多线程吞吐上限就是单核吞吐加上切换开销，线程数再多也只是把同一份 CPU 时间切片轮流用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>能否受益于多线程</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CPU-bound（JSON 解析、图像缩放、加密）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>同时段只有一条线程执行字节码，受限于单核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I/O-bound（<code>requests</code>、<code>socket</code>、<code>time.sleep</code>）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>阻塞调用会释放 GIL，其他线程可立即接手</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C 扩展主动释放 GIL（<code>numpy</code>、<code>hashlib</code>、<code>zlib</code>）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>计算发生在 C 层且不持锁，真正并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多核扩展（<code>multiprocessing</code>）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>进程级隔离，每进程一把独立 GIL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"切换检查点-线程在哪些位置让出-gil\">切换检查点：线程在哪些位置让出 GIL</h2><p>让出不是定时中断，而是「运行到某个特定字节码时顺便检查」。这些位置叫检查点（checkpoint），分布在三个层次。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>求值循环的跳转回边。</strong> 在 CPython 3.10 及更早版本，<code>ceval.c</code> 用一条 <code>if (--_Py_Ticker &lt; 0) { _Py_Ticker = _Py_CheckInterval; ... }</code> 作为通用检查，默认每 100 条指令（<code>_Py_CheckInterval = 100</code>）检查一次。3.11 起 <code>_Py_Ticker</code> 被移除，改由 <code>eval_breaker</code> 中的 <code>GIL_DROP_REQUEST_BIT</code> 在 <code>CHECK_EVAL_BREAKER()</code> 处体现；3.12 进一步把检查收敛到少数几个「回边」（backward edge，即循环跳转）指令上。</li>\n<li><strong>显式释放点。</strong> <code>time.sleep()</code>、<code>select</code> 类阻塞、文件与网络 I/O 的 C 实现会在进入系统调用前调用 <code>Py_BEGIN_ALLOW_THREADS</code> 宏，主动释放 GIL，返回后重新获取。</li>\n<li><strong>扩展作者的显式点。</strong> CPython 用 <code>PyEval_SaveThread()/PyEval_RestoreThread()</code> 组合提供同一能力，<code>numpy</code> 的重计算、<code>hashlib</code> 的摘要运算都在这里放开锁。</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[线程 T1 持有 GIL&lt;br/&gt;执行字节码] --&gt; B{到达检查点?&lt;br/&gt;回边/求值循环}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| A&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C{eval_breaker&lt;br/&gt;有 GIL_DROP_REQUEST?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否 继续跑| A&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[drop_gil&lt;br/&gt;把 GIL 交给等待队列]&#10;  D --&gt; E[等待线程被 OS 唤醒&lt;br/&gt;竞争获取 GIL]&#10;  E --&gt; F{等待超时?&lt;br/&gt;FORCE_SWITCHING}&#10;  F --&gt;|超时且无人接手| G[该线程强制放弃&lt;br/&gt;让给别人]&#10;  F --&gt;|有线程接手| H[T2 获得 GIL&lt;br/&gt;开始执行]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  A --&gt;|进入阻塞系统调用| I[Py_BEGIN_ALLOW_THREADS&lt;br/&gt;主动释放 GIL]&#10;  I --&gt; J[其他线程立即接手&lt;br/&gt;T1 在 C 层并行]&#10;  J --&gt; K[系统调用返回&lt;br/&gt;重新获取 GIL 继续]\">graph TD\n  A[线程 T1 持有 GIL&lt;br/&gt;执行字节码] --&gt; B{到达检查点?&lt;br/&gt;回边/求值循环}\n  B --&gt;|否| A\n  B --&gt;|是| C{eval_breaker&lt;br/&gt;有 GIL_DROP_REQUEST?}\n  C --&gt;|否 继续跑| A\n  C --&gt;|是| D[drop_gil&lt;br/&gt;把 GIL 交给等待队列]\n  D --&gt; E[等待线程被 OS 唤醒&lt;br/&gt;竞争获取 GIL]\n  E --&gt; F{等待超时?&lt;br/&gt;FORCE_SWITCHING}\n  F --&gt;|超时且无人接手| G[该线程强制放弃&lt;br/&gt;让给别人]\n  F --&gt;|有线程接手| H[T2 获得 GIL&lt;br/&gt;开始执行]\n  G --&gt; H\n  A --&gt;|进入阻塞系统调用| I[Py_BEGIN_ALLOW_THREADS&lt;br/&gt;主动释放 GIL]\n  I --&gt; J[其他线程立即接手&lt;br/&gt;T1 在 C 层并行]\n  J --&gt; K[系统调用返回&lt;br/&gt;重新获取 GIL 继续]</pre><p>这里的关键设计是**「请求让出」而不是「抢占」**。等待中的线程不会强行夺锁，而是在 <code>drop_gil</code> 路径里把 <code>gil_drop_request</code> 置位，由当前持锁线程在自己跑到的下一个检查点主动交出来。这样切换永远发生在 opcode 边界，解释器内部不会被打断在半成品状态，省掉了大量细粒度锁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sys-setswitchinterval-的代价模型\">sys.setswitchinterval 的代价模型</h2><p><code>sys.setswitchinterval(interval)</code> 设置的 <code>interval</code> 单位是<strong>秒</strong>，默认 <code>0.005</code>（5 毫秒），对应 CPython 的 <code>_PyEval_SetSwitchInterval</code>。它<strong>不是</strong>「每 5ms 强制切一次」的定时器，而是一条<strong>下限</strong>：一个请求让出的等待线程最多忍 5ms，超时后触发的机制叫强制切换（forced switching），这时原本没有主动让出的线程会在下一个检查点被迫交出 GIL。</p>\n<p>真正决定一次切换是否发生的，是两个时钟的叠加：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>hold</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>I</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>check</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>check</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>instr</mtext></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>IPC</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{hold}} = \\max\\left(\\frac{I}{k},\\, t_{\\text{check}}\\right),\\qquad t_{\\text{check}} \\approx \\frac{n_{\\text{instr}}}{f_{\\text{IPC}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hold</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">check</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">check</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.988em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">IPC</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">instr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <code>switchinterval</code>（秒），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>check</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{check}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">check</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是相邻两个检查点之间的执行时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>instr</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{\\text{instr}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">instr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是检查点间隔内的指令数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>IPC</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{\\text{IPC}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">IPC</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是每秒可执行的字节码条数。把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I = 5\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span> 代入，若单线程每秒能跑约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\times10^7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 条字节码，则一个检查点间隔大约覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.5\\times10^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 条指令——换句话说，<strong>在 5ms 的窗口里，一条 CPU-bound 线程会跑掉二十五万条字节码才可能让出一次</strong>。这就是为什么把线程数从 4 加到 16，CPU-bound 吞吐几乎不动：切换频率远低于线程数增长带来的收益。</p>\n<p>反过来，把 <code>interval</code> 调小能改善延迟敏感场景。交易撮合、风控打分这类服务希望「另一条线程等待不超过 1ms」，可以 <code>sys.setswitchinterval(0.001)</code>；代价是切换次数按比例上升，每次切换包含一次 OS 线程调度与锁竞争，CPU 时间被上下文切换吃掉。经验区间大致如下表（数值随机器与负载浮动，仅作量级参考）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><code>switchinterval</code></th>\n<th>每线程平均持有量级</th>\n<th>切换频率</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>主要代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>0.05</code>（放大）</td>\n<td>~50ms</td>\n<td>很低</td>\n<td>单线程为主、仅少量后台任务</td>\n<td>其他线程响应最坏可达 50ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>0.005</code>（默认）</td>\n<td>~5ms</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>通用 I/O 混合负载</td>\n<td>平衡点，适合大多数服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>0.001</code></td>\n<td>~1ms</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n<td>低延迟要求、线程数少</td>\n<td>切换开销占比上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>0.0001</code></td>\n<td>~0.1ms</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极端低延迟、专用进程</td>\n<td>上下文切换可能吃掉可观 CPU</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三条实践规则值得记住。第一，<strong><code>interval</code> 不是越小越好</strong>：切到微秒级后，OS 的线程唤醒延迟可能比 GIL 持有时间还长，实际延迟不降反升。第二，<strong>它只对「有字节码执行」的线程有意义</strong>：一条线程如果大部分时间在 <code>Py_BEGIN_ALLOW_THREADS</code> 里等网络，它根本不持 GIL，调 <code>interval</code> 对它没影响。第三，<strong>它是进程级全局设置</strong>：<code>sys.setswitchinterval()</code> 改的是解释器状态，多线程共享，<code>python -X switchinterval=0.001</code> 或环境变量 <code>PYTHONSWITCHINTERVAL</code> 可在启动时覆盖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与阻塞释放的协同-为什么-asyncio-在-i-o-场景更快\">与阻塞释放的协同：为什么 asyncio 在 I/O 场景更快</h2><p>回到开头的报价聚合服务。16 个线程各自 <code>requests.get()</code>，每次请求进入 socket 阻塞前释放 GIL，返回后重新排队抢锁。I/O 期间确实并行了，但由于 GIL 的存在，<strong>线程的唤醒与重入变成一次锁竞争</strong>：16 条线程在同一把锁上排队，唤醒顺序不确定，还要承担切换开销，所以看起来只快了几倍。</p>\n<p>换成 <code>asyncio</code> 后，事件循环是单线程的，协程在 <code>await</code> 处让出的是<strong>控制权而非 GIL</strong>——没有锁竞争，没有线程切换，只在 I/O 完成时把回调塞回队列。当并发量上升到数百上千时，省下的正是 GIL 竞争与线程调度这两块成本。这也是 2026 年的主流选型：I/O 密集用 <code>asyncio</code>（或 <code>anyio</code>/<code>uvloop</code>），CPU 密集用 <code>multiprocessing</code> 或 C 扩展释放 GIL，而「多线程跑 CPU-bound」只在少数场景（如 C 扩展主动放锁）才成立。</p>\n<p>有一类反例必须点出：<code>settimeout</code> 下的 <code>socket</code> 行为、以及没有释放 GIL 的纯 Python C 扩展调用，会让线程在持有 GIL 的状态下等待，此时 <code>switchinterval</code> 就成了唯一救场机制——超时后强制切换保证其他线程仍能推进。理解这一点，才能在看 CPU profile 时正确区分「在等 I/O」与「在等 GIL」。</p>\n<p>GIL 的这条设计线在 2026 年已经开始松动：CPython 3.13（PEP 703 的可选构建）提供了 <code>--disable-gil</code> 的实验性自由线程模式，3.14 在此基础上继续收窄差距，但自由线程构建下的单线程性能与生态兼容性仍是取舍，主流生产环境默认仍运行带 GIL 的解释器。延伸阅读见同章的 <a href=\"threading-subinterpreter-multiprocessing-model\">并发运行时选型：多线程、子解释器与多进程边界</a> 与 <a href=\"cpu-bound-io-release-patterns\">GIL 释放形态与并发异常排查</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本核算-把三个变量放进一张表\">成本核算：把三个变量放进一张表</h2><p>把「为什么多线程不线性扩展」算成一条可解释的式子，比记住结论更有用。设单线程 CPU-bound 吞吐为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>（单位：任务/秒），线程数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，那么吞吐上限近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mi>P</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>switch</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>contend</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>work</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_N \\approx \\frac{P}{1 + c\\,(N-1)},\\qquad c = \\frac{t_{\\text{switch}} + t_{\\text{contend}}}{t_{\\text{work}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2963em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1281em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">work</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">switch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">contend</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是「每次切换加竞争的开销 / 每次有效工作时间」，由 <code>switchinterval</code>、检查点密度和 OS 调度共同决定。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 越小，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>；由于 GIL 使分母中的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>work</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{work}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">work</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 无法被多核并行摊薄，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 增大只会让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(N-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 线性变差。这就是「加线程反而更慢」的定量解释，也是判断「该不该换进程/异步」的依据：先量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，再决定是调 <code>switchinterval</code>（降低切换频次）还是换并发模型（消除 GIL 本身）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>GIL 不是「线程安全开关」，而是解释器引用计数、字节码执行与容器结构三条不变量的承载物；它的切换发生在检查点而非定时中断，<code>sys.setswitchinterval</code> 只提供让出的下限，默认 5ms 意味着 CPU-bound 线程可能跑完二十五万条字节码才让一次。因此「多线程扩 CPU」在默认配置下近乎无效，正确的工程路径是按负载性质分派到 <code>asyncio</code>、<code>multiprocessing</code> 或释放 GIL 的 C 扩展，并把自由线程构建当作 2026 年仍处实验阶段的备选项而非默认答案。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用 <code>sys.getswitchinterval()</code> 确认进程实际值，别假设是 5ms——容器镜像、<code>uvicorn</code> 启动参数都可能改过它。</li>\n<li>CPU-bound 任务先量单线程吞吐，再用 <code>multiprocessing</code>/<code>ProcessPoolExecutor</code> 扩到多核，而不是加线程。</li>\n<li>I/O-bound 任务优先 <code>asyncio</code>；确需线程时确认阻塞调用确实释放 GIL（<code>requests</code>、标准 socket 均会释放）。</li>\n<li>自研 C 扩展在长计算前用 <code>Py_BEGIN_ALLOW_THREADS</code> 放锁，否则它会把整个进程钉在单核上。</li>\n<li>低延迟服务可试 <code>sys.setswitchinterval(0.001)</code>，但要用 <code>perf</code>/<code>py-spy</code> 验证切换开销没有反噬吞吐。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GIL 设计原理：全局锁语义、切换检查点与 sys.setswitchinterval 的代价模型","id":"gil-设计原理-全局锁语义-切换检查点与-sys-setswitchinterval-的代价模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：GIL 保护的语义与运行时不变量","id":"核心概念-gil-保护的语义与运行时不变量"},{"level":2,"text":"切换检查点：线程在哪些位置让出 GIL","id":"切换检查点-线程在哪些位置让出-gil"},{"level":2,"text":"sys.setswitchinterval 的代价模型","id":"sys-setswitchinterval-的代价模型"},{"level":2,"text":"与阻塞释放的协同：为什么 asyncio 在 I/O 场景更快","id":"与阻塞释放的协同-为什么-asyncio-在-i-o-场景更快"},{"level":2,"text":"成本核算：把三个变量放进一张表","id":"成本核算-把三个变量放进一张表"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"局部变量、异常展开与栈回溯：零开销异常表、trace/profile 钩子与调试接入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/cpython-interpreter-gil-memory-internals/interpreter-bytecode-execution/frame-locals-exception-unwinding"},"next":{"title":"并发运行时选型：多线程、子解释器 per-interpreter GIL 与多进程共享模型的边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/cpython-interpreter-gil-memory-internals/gil-concurrency-runtime/threading-subinterpreter-multiprocessing-model"}}